        <mxCell id="title" value="LeafMap Insights – Component Diagram (Obzor na sistemata)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="120" y="12" width="700" height="28" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tech-214" value="2.1.4. Избор на технологии – Системата: 4 приложения (2 API, 2 клиента).&#xa;Backend: ASP.NET Core Web API, Entity Framework Core, SQL Server, ASP.NET Core Identity, JWT Bearer.&#xa;Web: Node.js, Express (static + GET /api-config), HTML/JS, JWT v localStorage.&#xa;Mobile: .NET MAUI.&#xa;Критерии: съвместимост, поддръжка, възможност за екип с .NET опит и възможност за общ API договор." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=10;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="300" width="780" height="80" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
